    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 04 VISUAL GUIDE · POLE 3</div>\n    <h4>Automations — a queue of obligations that must be carried</h4>\n    <p>The hot-potato closure contract and the wake ladder</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 380\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"16\" width=\"880\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">★ THE HOT-POTATO CLOSURE CONTRACT</text>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">You cannot finish a task without saying where it went</text>\n\n      <path d=\"M 460 70 L 460 96\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-04)\"/>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 100)\">\n        <rect width=\"420\" height=\"118\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">state=done REQUIRES one of 7 reasons</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a pure, I/O-free validator owns the rule</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">and THREE of the reasons additionally</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">require a closure_target</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">handed_off_to · blocked_on · escalation</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">→ NO unit of work can vanish</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(480, 100)\">\n        <rect width=\"420\" height=\"118\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE TRANSACTIONAL HANDOFF</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the baton AND its wake-intent are staged</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">in the SAME transaction</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">delivered after commit</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">reconciled once at startup</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">a crash cannot orphan a handoff</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"238\" width=\"880\" height=\"128\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#059669\">★ THE WAKE LADDER — its invariant, stated in words</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"292\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE ROW CARRIES THE OBLIGATION EXACTLY-ONCE; THE WAKE IS AT-LEAST-ONCE.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"316\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">It retries the POINTER, never the content — so a retry cannot double-deliver. State is DERIVED from the transition log,</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"336\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">so a restart can neither forget a ladder nor restart its counts. A rendered-unconfirmed false negative is treated differently</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"356\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">from a true failure: it never retries, but escalates directly (escalation cannot double-deliver).</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
