    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 06 VISUAL GUIDE · PZ</div>\n    <h4>Out-of-pole — the gate culture</h4>\n    <p>The four-rail exclusion ledger, and a green that carries the load it ran under</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 400\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"16\" width=\"880\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">★ “A GREEN IS ONLY AS GOOD AS WHAT COULD HAVE BEEN RED”</text>\n      <text x=\"460\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">The verdict RECORDS per-leg time, ambient load, and the mode it ran in — sealed, not printed</text>\n\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 82)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"104\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE MUTEX</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a bound localhost port</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">no stale-lock class</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">5 pins; alternatives named</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">refuse, never queue</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(248, 82)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"104\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE SINGLE READ</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">read the mode flag ONCE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#ef4444\">two reads can diverge;</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#ef4444\">one cannot</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">+ per-leg time = the</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">independent cross-check</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(476, 82)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"104\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE GUARDS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">4 guard scripts</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">each with a co-located test</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">1 shared rule engine</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">a named remedy per finding</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(704, 82)\">\n        <rect width=\"196\" height=\"104\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE SELF-DESTRUCT</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a bridge with a deletion</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">contract — and it expired</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">+ a TOMBSTONE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">+ a test it STAYS dead</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"204\" width=\"880\" height=\"180\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"232\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#059669\">★ THE FOUR-RAIL EXCLUSION LEDGER — a gate that can be green WITH named exceptions</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"260\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">RAIL 1 · green-with-exclusions — a covered failure still PASSES the gate, but the resident is NAMED in-band.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"282\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">RAIL 2 · mechanical expiry — a resident past its expiry FAILS the gate even if its suite now passes (“self-dying”).</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"304\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">RAIL 3 · receipt + owner + expiry — mandatory; an invalid ledger is a LOUD failure, never a silent pass.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"326\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">RAIL 4 · cut ceiling — no exclusion may expire after the cut. Exceptions cannot rot into permanent exemptions.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"352\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">AND IT SHIPS EMPTY, BY DESIGN — “the named-6 were KILLED, not excluded, so main is truly green.”</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"372\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Establishes the advisory / advisory-but-recorded / enforcing vocabulary — each tier named where it is used.</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
