    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 07 VISUAL GUIDE · SYNTHESIS</div>\n    <h4>The synthesis — where OpenRig sits, and what we take</h4>\n    <p>Three tiers of mechanism, the ranked order, and the two measured zeros</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 400\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-07\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-07\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-07\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"285\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">TIER 1 — ADOPT NOW</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">1 · the 4-rail exclusion ledger</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">2 · green carries the load</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">3 · single-read + cross-check</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">4 · self-destruct + tombstone</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">5 · the strip invariant</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"129\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">6 · guard-as-document</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"146\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">7 · the exact-path exception</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(318, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"285\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">TIER 2 — WHEN WE BUILD IT</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the digital-twin harness</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the permission seam</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the one command registry</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the 3-tier advisory vocabulary</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a named remedy per finding</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"129\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">refusal that teaches</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"146\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">the declarative surface contract</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(616, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"284\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">TIER 3 — OBSERVE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the kernel-released mutex</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">hermeticity by derivation</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the compiled-package probe</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">layout = authority</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">the redacted CI summary</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"129\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">the self-audited doc set</text>\n      </g>\n\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"186\" width=\"880\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"212\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">★ OPENRIG’S ONE STRUCTURAL ANSWER</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"238\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">“The gate should be as honest as the product.”</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"262\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Verification machinery is itself a design surface — and the honest version is mostly RECORDS, not checks.</text>\n\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"296\" width=\"880\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"322\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ef4444\">THE TWO MEASURED ZEROS</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"348\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">NO TENANCY (0 tenant_id) · NO WIDGET MODEL — the two things the mapping turns on, answered with measured zeros.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"372\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#059669\">Two independent platforms lacking them is the strongest argument we have for building both.</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
